  "retained_disclosed_limits": [
    "Ordinary0.15mm surface faults can bypass/load gates or ground OUT; no universal single-component-fault tolerance is claimed. Mandatory coating/cold checks do not prevent a later bridge.",
    "USB/self-powered back-feed can conceal J400 opening; direct GPS/radio have no off-state isolation or software power cutoff. E-match connection excludes every back-feed source.",
    "Unfused BAT_IN/entry/TVS/cap risks and external servo faults can remove the primary computer; isolated Blue Jay remains required.",
    "No R10 firmware exists. Launch detection, ground hard refusals, in-flight never-veto, trace locks/loader handling, watchdog/no-refresh/current tail, hot R134/source/harness/actual lot20ms firing are unimplemented/unmeasured.",
    "Sense absolute-stress arithmetic does not establish accurate ADC conversion after a fault, hot leakage/noise thresholds, powered-off behavior or waveform immunity.",
    "Native and constant-power calculations do not qualify hot-plug, hold-up, thermal/current sharing, installed RF/ESD, switching bounce/dry contact, coating/workmanship, harness/retention, physical bore/stack or first article."
  ],
